    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No docs. No tutorial. No escape.</h2>Tackle an evolving spectrum of puzzles within a simulated computer system using only terminal commands.  Inspired by a bad day with a package manager.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809460/extras/e203b5f39275af1df28ea4282f248b1b.avif?t=1724777197\" width=620 height=138 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME, [APPLICANT_NAME]</h2>This evaluation has been designed to assess your knowledge and reasoning skills, critical components for securing a position at PRAET.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY POINTS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>SCORING</strong>: Achieving a high score significantly enhances your prospects for employment with PRAET. Conversely, failure will result in immediate disqualification from the recruitment process.\u00b9<br></li><li><strong>TIME ALLOCATION</strong>: While there is no official time limit, the average applicant completes this scenario within 4 hours.\u00b2<br></li><li><strong>OBJECTIVE</strong>: Your primary objective in this scenario is to SUCCESSFULLY EXECUTE THE ESCAPE COMMAND.</li></ul><i>\u00b9Recruiters forfeit their referral bonus for any dismissed applicants. (See form FB-6 \u00b6B612 or contact recruitment HR for details)<br>\u00b2Applicants are required to provide their own sustenance during the evaluation. (See form FB-2 \u00b6B6254)</i><br><br>Good luck.",
